#: 850d869f6499453180d69a8f4210fb6f
msgid "神经网络模块 (net.py)"
msgstr "Neural Network Module (net.py)"

#: ffc10776fb2444239dd260933e8a39ec
msgid "这个模块定义了 HamGNN 的核心网络架构。"
msgstr "This module defines the core network architecture of HamGNN."

#: 3f8fe49b4cba43adaf7cd4f0efd43278
msgid ""
"主要包含三个部分： 1.  `HamGNN_pre` / `HamGNN_pre2` / `HamGNN_pre_charge`: "
"这一系列是特征提取网络（或称为表示网络），"
msgstr ""
"It mainly consists of three parts: 1. `HamGNN_pre` / `HamGNN_pre2` / "
"`HamGNN_pre_charge`: This series of networks are feature extraction networks "
"(or representation networks),"

#: e24d907f2a7541a691d498b699db8c08
msgid ""
"负责从输入的原子结构（节点、边）中学习具有 O(3) 等变性的特征表示。它们基于 `nequip` 框架， "
"通过多层消息传递（卷积）来构建节点和边的特征。"
msgstr ""
"responsible for learning O(3) equivariant feature representations from the "
"input atomic structure (nodes, edges). They are based on the `nequip` "
"framework and build node and edge features through multi-layer message "
"passing (convolution)."

#: 480597a81c5547b8b457ba0f87aa8d0d
msgid ""
"`HamGNN_out`: 这是输出网络，它接收来自表示网络的等变特征，并利用这些特征构建 等变的哈密顿量 (Hamiltonian) 和重叠矩阵"
" (Overlap Matrix)。"
msgstr ""
"`HamGNN_out`: This is the output network, which receives equivariant "
"features from the representation network and uses them to construct an "
"equivariant Hamiltonian and Overlap Matrix."

#: 6336ef2882a7441da16ae9e68e7ae082
msgid ""
"辅助模块和类: 如 `residual_block`, `Edge_builder`, `Triplet_builder` 等， "
"这些是构成上述核心网络的积木块。"
msgstr ""
"Auxiliary modules and classes: such as `residual_block`, `Edge_builder`, "
"`Triplet_builder`, etc., which are the building blocks of the core networks "
"mentioned above."

#: 1eeff73329524b2bb868e4872350c7e5 2a126f8d690b41008a1510e72d0c863e
