#: 5fe88013e78540c28882b086bfb16b41
msgid "`Edge_builder` 的一个变体，使用两个不同节点特征的张量积。"
msgstr "A variant of `Edge_builder` that uses the tensor product of two different node features."

#: 6cfcbc177c634fc0800075f5d5744df6
msgid ""
"这个模块将源节点特征和目标节点特征分别进行线性变换后，直接进行张量积， 而不是像 `Edge_builder` "
"那样先将它们相加。这允许模型学习更复杂的、 非对称的相互作用。最终计算出的特征会累加到已有的边特征上。"
msgstr ""
"This module performs a tensor product directly after linearly transforming "
"the source and target node features, instead of adding them first like in "
"`Edge_builder`. This allows the model to learn more complex, asymmetric "
"interactions. The finally calculated features are accumulated onto the "
"existing edge features."

#: 73c47e7591b643ccb0e45e3a5bb09a5d
msgid "构建三元组（triplet, k-j-i）特征的模块。"
msgstr "A module for building triplet (k-j-i) features."

#: 27b5d988771146d699ccd4dec7996fdf
msgid ""
"此模块旨在捕捉原子间的三体相互作用信息。它通过张量积组合两条 相连边（k->j 和 j->i）的特征来创建三元组特征。张量积的权重由 "
"这三点形成的夹角嵌入（通过球谐函数计算）来动态调节。"
msgstr ""
"This module aims to capture three-body interaction information between "
"atoms. It creates triplet features by combining the features of two "
"connected edges (k->j and j->i) through a tensor product. The weights of "
"the tensor product are dynamically adjusted by the angle embedding (calculated "
"via spherical harmonics) formed by these three points."

#: 51fc7a64e6244fb8a31256acea7909ce
msgid "用于角度嵌入的球谐函数层。"
msgstr "Spherical harmonics layer for angle embedding."

#: bbdbc69bbd0a471c976c6903187e6dd9
msgid "sph_harm_layer"
msgstr "sph_harm_layer"

#: 38a7f5c08fe44e73a1e6453e4fa4029c
msgid "边 k->j 特征的线性变换层。"
msgstr "Linear transformation layer for edge k->j features."

#: 38356a0b82b149c99ba5b0ca6b41c087
msgid "边 j->i 特征的线性变换层。"
msgstr "Linear transformation layer for edge j->i features."

#: c2fea7c0194f4c9cb024992eee6efdc0
msgid "根据角度嵌入生成张量积权重的全连接网络。"
msgstr "A fully connected network that generates tensor product weights based on angle embeddings."

#: d1570e9a53ad4619bdc921536825ef11
msgid "计算图中的所有三元组 (k->j->i)。"
msgstr "Calculate all triplets (k->j->i) in the graph."

#: 21bd001d9bdd42b0991cd6c6f2c58698
msgid ""
"利用 `torch_sparse` 的 `SparseTensor` 高效地寻找相连的边。 一个三元组由中心原子 j，以及两个邻居 i 和 k "
"构成。"
msgstr ""
"Efficiently find connected edges using `torch_sparse.SparseTensor`. A "
"triplet consists of a central atom j and two neighbors i and k."

