#: a300271032c94bc8bcbf869c415e5754
msgid ""
"包含三元组信息的元组 (col, row, idx_i, idx_j, idx_k, idx_kj, idx_ji)。        其中 "
"idx_i, idx_j, idx_k 是三元组中原子的索引。        idx_kj, idx_ji 是构成三元组的两条边的索引。"
msgstr ""
"A tuple containing triplet information (col, row, idx_i, idx_j, idx_k, "
"idx_kj, idx_ji). where idx_i, idx_j, idx_k are the indices of the atoms in "
"the triplet. idx_kj, idx_ji are the indices of the two edges that form the "
"triplet."

#: bb67d46065304a84b67478b1ad9da950
msgid "包含三元组信息的元组 (col, row, idx_i, idx_j, idx_k, idx_kj, idx_ji)。"
msgstr ""
"A tuple containing triplet information (col, row, idx_i, idx_j, idx_k, "
"idx_kj, idx_ji)."

#: 89cf62a746bd4ab18954ea0bbee3932c
msgid "其中 idx_i, idx_j, idx_k 是三元组中原子的索引。 idx_kj, idx_ji 是构成三元组的两条边的索引。"
msgstr ""
"where idx_i, idx_j, idx_k are the indices of the atoms in the triplet. "
"idx_kj, idx_ji are the indices of the two edges that form the triplet."

#: 02c819da1d9d4d1fadff305b939a4525
msgid "一个简单的哈密顿量预测层。"
msgstr "A simple Hamiltonian prediction layer."

#: f5f48fea5cde47a3885044f6b2cb9600
msgid "该层由一个残差块和一个最终的线性层组成，用于将学习到的特征 映射到最终的输出空间（例如，哈密顿量矩阵的元素）。"
msgstr ""
"This layer consists of a residual block and a final linear layer, used to "
"map the learned features to the final output space (e.g., the elements of "
"the Hamiltonian matrix)."

#: 09fc61e64ea745cead0fcf8552aad3c0
msgid "一个残差连接块，用于深化网络和稳定训练。"
msgstr "A residual connection block for deepening the network and stabilizing training."

#: ecdee3df8d2143f7baf9bbf1681376c9
msgid "residual_block"
msgstr "residual_block"

#: 8ddca76f13b94c20a58a1b3c09b036dd
msgid "一个等变线性层，用于输出最终结果。"
msgstr "An equivariant linear layer for outputting the final result."

#: 819d105f6a7645b3a1f02a627010bf43
msgid "HamGNN 的特征提取网络（也称为表示网络）。"
msgstr "The feature extraction network of HamGNN (also known as the representation network)."

#: d7fb558ea734441fb55287417b5373f3
msgid ""
"这个网络基于 `nequip` 架构，通过一系列精心设计的嵌入和等变卷积层， 从原子结构（节点、边、角度）中学习丰富的、考虑了对称性的特征表示。 "
"这些特征随后可以被用于预测各种物理属性。"
msgstr ""
"This network is based on the `nequip` architecture and learns rich, "
"symmetry-aware feature representations from the atomic structure (nodes, "
"edges, angles) through a series of carefully designed embeddings and "
"equivariant convolutional layers. These features can then be used to predict "
"various physical properties."

#: 818bf41851b64ebbaba489f2cc7b0286
msgid "将原子类型编码为 one-hot 向量。"
msgstr "Encodes atom types into one-hot vectors."

#: 4736009935104218aadf752a5bfc3223
msgid "OneHotAtomEncoding"
msgstr "OneHotAtomEncoding"

#: e94de954117c43b6b71eac38b2f98fc8
msgid "将边的方向向量编码为球谐函数特征。"
msgstr "Encodes the direction vectors of edges into spherical harmonic features."

#: 57edfa37e364495786ef6d424316b6f4
msgid "SphericalHarmonicEdgeAttrs"
msgstr "SphericalHarmonicEdgeAttrs"

#: 0c612200cb564b6a81e0b1cd115d8f2e
msgid "将边的距离编码为径向基函数特征。"
msgstr "Encodes the distances of edges into radial basis function features."

#: 6edb59028f38423b88d9d83576308566
msgid "RadialBasisEdgeEncoding"
msgstr "RadialBasisEdgeEncoding"

#: ce3d467336e34c238cfc2c6aabe6781a
msgid "将 one-hot 编码线性映射到初始节点特征。"
msgstr "Linearly maps one-hot encodings to initial node features."

#: a5b7ebfbf61445cbb4ce2be2932785f6 f3d7f9df9ba8455584caea7157bf4867
msgid "AtomwiseLinear"
msgstr "AtomwiseLinear"

#: 6a916aa21edb4ba78eb123b7800b249b
msgid "包含多个等变卷积层的列表。"
msgstr "A list containing multiple equivariant convolutional layers."

#: 8406fb1d3fe043238ed51370c7411b7c
msgid "nn.ModuleList"
msgstr "nn.ModuleList"

#: 1801b3b3c350479e85b13482e1e5c400
msgid "将卷积后的节点特征映射到最终输出。"
msgstr "Maps the convolved node features to the final output."

#: ad34fae2111c4941a999d96f628ad97e
msgid "从节点特征和边属性构建最终的边特征。"
msgstr "Builds final edge features from node features and edge attributes."

#: 6b99e7b7c5724641950829a5f7e37fda
msgid "Edge_builder"
msgstr "Edge_builder"

#: 724b59c263374947a3e3edddfda15c9a
msgid "如果启用，构建三元组特征。"
msgstr "If enabled, builds triplet features."

#: 329141fea60c41848160ce91eb3029c8
msgid "Triplet_builder, optional"
msgstr "Triplet_builder, optional"

#: b3a98f1ab19d4de7b21d48ddfa6a8bff
msgid "包含原子图信息的字典。"
msgstr "A dictionary containing atomic graph information."

#: af6b0c1fd1e64ab8a8c1faf2d8c71ded
msgid "批处理索引。默认为 None。"
msgstr "Batch index. Defaults to None."

#: dd64e8d78cc94b7f9bd0837c11c07131
msgid "包含计算出的节点、边和（可选）三元组特征的字典。"
msgstr ""
"A dictionary containing the calculated node, edge, and (optional) triplet "
"features."

#: 7e5490def0024fc1a4ae3474db539d3d
msgid "`HamGNN_pre` 的一个变体。"
msgstr "A variant of `HamGNN_pre`."

#: 8fc112ba7e61451e8fe9a6c74cdf4582
msgid "主要区别在于： - 使用 `Embedding_block` 代替 `OneHotAtomEncoding`，允许更灵活的初始节点嵌入，"
msgstr ""
"The main difference is: - Uses `Embedding_block` instead of "
"`OneHotAtomEncoding`, allowing for more flexible initial node embeddings,"

#: 597ffb0dad274ef2829d50f7c70b03cb
msgid "而不仅仅是原子类型的 one-hot 编码。"
msgstr "rather than just one-hot encoding of atom types."

#: 69bf4f043168430abe7266ffed6bbdaa
msgid "增加了一个可选的 `Edge_builder_tp` 层，用于引入额外的、通过不同节点特征 张量积计算的边特征，以增强模型的表达能力。"
msgstr ""
"Adds an optional `Edge_builder_tp` layer to introduce additional edge "
"features calculated through the tensor product of different node features, "
"enhancing the model's expressive power."

#: 192ed145222941ab8cc3e8da5d5a230e
msgid "`HamGNN_pre` 的另一个变体，增加了对电荷掺杂的支持。"
msgstr "Another variant of `HamGNN_pre` that adds support for charge doping."

#: 8deb4ee1ae8b4bccb377f0a28ccf105a
msgid ""
"它使用 `Embedding_block_q`，该模块可以接收每个节点的电荷信息作为额外的 "
"节点属性，并将其与原子类型嵌入相结合，生成考虑了电荷状态的初始节点特征。 这使得模型能够学习电荷对体系性质的影响。"
msgstr ""
"It uses `Embedding_block_q`, a module that can receive charge information "
"for each node as an additional node attribute and combine it with the atom "
"type embedding to generate initial node features that consider the charge "
"state. This allows the model to learn the effect of charge on the system's "
"properties."

#: 8c0b6b871abc4ccb94e4ad2f29ea802e
msgid "HamGNN 的输出模块，用于从学习到的特征构建哈密顿量和重叠矩阵。"
msgstr ""
"The output module of HamGNN, used to construct the Hamiltonian and overlap "
"matrix from the learned features."

#: b4287b66b3b64e808689c1f0bfe1f759
msgid ""
"这个模块是 HamGNN 的核心物理构建模块。它接收由表示网络（如 `HamGNN_pre`） "
"生成的节点和边特征，然后通过几个专门的网络（onsitenet, offsitenet）将这些 "
"特征映射到局域的哈密顿量和重SAO（Symmetrized Atomic Orbitals）基矢下的 重叠矩阵元素。"
msgstr ""
"This module is the core physical building block of HamGNN. It receives the "
"node and edge features generated by the representation network (such as "
"`HamGNN_pre`) and then maps these features to the local Hamiltonian and "
"overlap matrix elements under the Symmetrized Atomic Orbitals (SAO) basis "
"through several specialized networks (onsitenet, offsitenet)."

#: 71959f165e3a48e688e05d098be0813f
msgid ""
"该模块内置了对多种 DFT 软件（OpenMX, SIESTA, ABACUS）基组定义的兼容性， "
"能够处理自旋轨道耦合（SOC），并能计算能带结构和原子受力。"
msgstr ""
"The module has built-in compatibility with basis set definitions from "
"various DFT software (OpenMX, SIESTA, ABACUS), can handle spin-orbit "
"coupling (SOC), and can calculate band structures and atomic forces."

#: ed7ab7be6a2d489faef61aeb2b878ec7
msgid "是否计算梯度（用于力）。"
msgstr "Whether to calculate gradients (for forces)."

#: 1bc093d9abf948bd8a67aaab5e3e7e07
msgid "是否创建计算图（用于高阶导数）。"
msgstr "Whether to create a computation graph (for higher-order derivatives)."

#: fc562cb912c64a439c105e2897ac398b
msgid "原子轨道基组的最大数量。"
msgstr "The maximum number of atomic orbital basis sets."

#: 609cebc5ba904384bcf66819408904a0
msgid "int"
msgstr "int"

#: e0b3615862f14c2a92d22fed8bd9b316
msgid "使用的 DFT 软件类型 ('openmx', 'siesta', 'abacus')。"
msgstr "The type of DFT software used ('openmx', 'siesta', 'abacus')."

#: 3cebf2a827b84843b500df59eb449c3c c5237e18fde3443b837d6fd184c9a258
msgid "str"
msgstr "str"

#: b8fa50881fc244528d9b3a408b98a4ba
msgid "是否只预测哈密顿量（不预测重叠矩阵）。"
msgstr "Whether to predict only the Hamiltonian (not the overlap matrix)."

#: daa749e75d68428385be72de4dc0de25
msgid "是否对生成的矩阵进行对称化处理。"
msgstr "Whether to symmetrize the generated matrix."

#: 70d030986c0442de8c730a726de42634
msgid "是否在计算中使用三元组特征。"
msgstr "Whether to use triplet features in the calculation."

#: e689b67a24744ee8b536bac849426c8d
msgid "是否开启自旋轨道耦合（SOC）。"
msgstr "Whether to enable spin-orbit coupling (SOC)."

#: da2c6e8297a44ab99ba48cdef37372c1
msgid "SOC计算使用的基组 ('so3' 或 'su2')。"
msgstr "The basis set used for SOC calculation ('so3' or 'su2')."

#: 9eb4dac23e804fa693ecbc14297328c9
msgid "用于预测在位（on-site）哈密顿量元素的网络层。"
msgstr "Network layer for predicting on-site Hamiltonian elements."

#: 828f6b589a79456984f71fdd97792311
msgid "用于预测异位（off-site）哈密顿量元素的网络层。"
msgstr "Network layer for predicting off-site Hamiltonian elements."

#: 9f60e429c7a94f72b96582128e2fc500
msgid "用于预测重叠矩阵元素的网络层。"
msgstr "Network layer for predicting overlap matrix elements."

#: 97db614891fc4a0892c594a2cee3529f
msgid "用于计算 Clebsch-Gordan 系数的工具。"
msgstr "A tool for calculating Clebsch-Gordan coefficients."

#: b5b976c4f3194ecabb8d6a0d075fb831
msgid "ClebschGordan"
msgstr "ClebschGordan"

#: a3249a2ad3c8481e94bbe850f93cc4f3
msgid "将以不可约表示形式存在的哈密顿量元素合并成矩阵块。"
msgstr ""
"Merges Hamiltonian elements that exist in irreducible representations into "
"matrix blocks."

#: a942e3e60ef448c2a047a9da44b2cfed
msgid "此函数执行逆球谐张量积操作，将网络输出的等变特征（sph_split） 通过 Clebsch-Gordan 系数重新组合成标准的矩阵形式。"
msgstr ""
"This function performs an inverse spherical harmonic tensor product "
"operation, reassembling the equivariant features (sph_split) output by the "
"network into a standard matrix form using Clebsch-Gordan coefficients."

#: b4558bc5206b433b9347811973bd02e4
msgid "包含不同不可约表示的特征张量列表。"
msgstr "A list of feature tensors containing different irreducible representations."

#: 1054c33eb6d14b2fb807c6ab5e7b38a4
msgid "合并后的矩阵块，形状为 [N, nao_max * nao_max]。"
msgstr "The merged matrix block, with shape [N, nao_max * nao_max]."

#: dd8087fa381f4d4d92da2daa2473f32b
msgid "根据不同 DFT 软件的原子轨道顺序，调整输出矩阵元素的顺序。"
msgstr ""
"Adjusts the order of the output matrix elements according to the atomic "
"orbital order of different DFT software."

#: bc908f4d873f4dcb8776d263a53831e2
msgid "输入的哈密顿量矩阵。"
msgstr "The input Hamiltonian matrix."

#: d34087828ee84ee5b05dfe628f82b117
msgid "调整顺序后的哈密顿量矩阵。"
msgstr "The reordered Hamiltonian matrix."

#: 4b5fee015b204c688268a060881978fc
msgid "将局域的在位和异位哈密顿量转换为完整的分子/晶胞哈密顿量。"
msgstr ""
"Converts local on-site and off-site Hamiltonians into a complete "
"molecular/unit cell Hamiltonian."

#: ac168e45d43a4ec3832796fba845357e ed214969fdb340cf8d29085b40c9ad1d
msgid "包含图结构和原子信息的字典。"
msgstr "A dictionary containing graph structure and atomic information."

#: 3608051053c048ab92396b1638226db4 f7d9a29df82c47fba03c5ed177b7b3f1
msgid "在位（on-site）哈密顿量块。"
msgstr "On-site Hamiltonian blocks."

#: 00b41eeefb2141528127e414b864ea7a 238e83d035294def808b764462c6327f
msgid "异位（off-site）哈密顿量块。"
msgstr "Off-site Hamiltonian blocks."

#: 749695cea41148889490342a8e28955d
msgid "构建的完整哈密顿量矩阵。"
msgstr "The constructed complete Hamiltonian matrix."

#: 203594f360364cb5bc17f04bb5213857
msgid "将批处理的在位和异位哈密顿量块连接成一个张量。"
msgstr "Concatenates batched on-site and off-site Hamiltonian blocks into a single tensor."

#: 0cb4987ce9b54ac5a9d29f9c32780293
msgid "连接后的哈密顿量张量。"
msgstr "The concatenated Hamiltonian tensor."

#: 13abf0a71c7c4d279699a86618d521d8
msgid "对称化在位哈密顿量/重叠矩阵。"
msgstr "Symmetrizes the on-site Hamiltonian/overlap matrix."

#: 4472ccbd9ab2447f8815781118640f7d e60278b11827426d97ff6f80e30e8e30
msgid "在位矩阵块。"
msgstr "On-site matrix blocks."

#: 8cabae4aa7f74d19acc726e9cbdbc316
msgid "对称化方式, '+' 表示 H, '-' 表示 H-H.T。默认为 '+'。"
msgstr "Symmetrization method, '+' for H, '-' for H-H.T. Defaults to '+'."

#: 6c4c9ae60e1a425bb4245f91860e5a6a f369dedad44c4349b817ba014d4acaa4
msgid "对称化后的矩阵块。"
msgstr "The symmetrized matrix block."

#: 7547a56a865e45bf8b2bfdca1595daa0
msgid "对称化异位哈密顿量/重叠矩阵。"
msgstr "Symmetrizes the off-site Hamiltonian/overlap matrix."

#: 5aefb55e7b8d436ea338626b44d34811
msgid "利用 H_ij = H_ji.T 的性质。"
msgstr "Utilizes the property H_ij = H_ji.T."

#: 14150e0cdabd46638487da9811c437e6 399e17a826954b8a87442fd32d3a0d9f
msgid "异位矩阵块。"
msgstr "Off-site matrix blocks."

#: 402ab5f4bfc045cd9fc52269b8f5d153
msgid "反向边的索引。"
msgstr "Index of the reverse edge."

#: edc53b91281b4c6bbaf18b22d611bc74
msgid "对称化方式。默认为 '+'。"
msgstr "Symmetrization method. Defaults to '+'."

#: 4fdb4fe51db64a45a847cd55f2897c5b
msgid "计算能带结构（调试版本）。"
msgstr "Calculate band structure (debug version)."

#: 41e65b91f56246ab9b719061d4638040
msgid "此函数通过在倒空间中构建哈密顿量和重叠矩阵，然后求解广义本征值问题 来计算能带。它包含了详细的步骤，用于调试和验证。"
msgstr ""
"This function calculates the band structure by constructing the Hamiltonian "
"and overlap matrices in reciprocal space and then solving the generalized "
"eigenvalue problem. It includes detailed steps for debugging and validation."

#: 38782d1a93194c3a8e6be9ff5a15c58d 414438f79d014530b416ab739f453b47
#: d0a135804a1445d782172ce225da86c1 e1ebd6a49c404e0da22ef5bd2f05a6a2
msgid "预测的在位和异位哈密顿量。"
msgstr "Predicted on-site and off-site Hamiltonians."

#: 70e1db2d7e0041cbb00edf5484fe3a4b d3a45a67356e4b63a4f2a5d79098d710
msgid "预测的在位和异位重叠矩阵。"
msgstr "Predicted on-site and off-site overlap matrices."

#: 0cc48f28ff29485f898db3b6a21adbac 9a9f71c46b3847fca4367f08d6f94e87
#: a1f7c76764c748f397058d57b961cc00 a6daff068465432cb50d3e6306b73e82
msgid "输入数据。"
msgstr "Input data."

#: 35c16d4af13b4b9895d26ae52c04f7cf 87dc9df6b3464b48848b31442fb844c4
msgid "是否导出倒空间矩阵。"
msgstr "Whether to export the reciprocal space matrices."

#: 6914c6f680cc421c88efb43a7ac17443
msgid "Returns:"
msgstr "Returns:"

#: 0c77472ebc49404089c465e35f7be4f8
msgid "计算能带结构（优化版本）。"
msgstr "Calculate band structure (optimized version)."

#: 2c353ecdf0bd4e1e9df0de038a21bf21
msgid "此函数是 `cal_band_energy_debug` 的优化版本，使用更高效的张量操作 来构建倒空间矩阵，以提高计算速度。"
msgstr ""
"This function is an optimized version of `cal_band_energy_debug`, using "
"more efficient tensor operations to construct the reciprocal space matrices "
"for improved computational speed."

#: b4eb32d0cf5c4f7b9ec27e418cf19e81
msgid "包含能带能量、波函数、带隙等信息的元组。"
msgstr ""
"A tuple containing information such as band energies, wave functions, and "
"band gap."

#: c079f9c692f946eba70a8dd9f7bfbfa3
msgid "计算包含自旋轨道耦合（SOC）的能带结构。"
msgstr "Calculate the band structure including spin-orbit coupling (SOC)."

#: a51b6734bbbf451ab3f971e923ec0a77
msgid ""
"此函数处理包含 SOC 效应的哈密顿量，该哈密顿量通常是复数且非对角 （在自旋空间中）。它分别构建哈密顿量的四个自旋分量（up-up, up-"
"down, down-up, down-down），然后在倒空间中组合它们，最后求解本征值问题。"
msgstr ""
"This function handles Hamiltonians that include SOC effects, which are "
"typically complex and non-diagonal (in spin space). It constructs the four "
"spin components of the Hamiltonian (up-up, up-down, down-up, down-down) "
"separately, combines them in reciprocal space, and finally solves the "
"eigenvalue problem."

#: 69372214eca749609c463679253ba55c 88505145ad5e4b21801098999a5590b3
msgid "在位SOC哈密顿量的实部和虚部。"
msgstr "The real and imaginary parts of the on-site SOC Hamiltonian."

#: 6fbd99ea7e7542f1a5f62bf12c1855a0 fe541845d6b847e2be5f800b686d5016
msgid "异位SOC哈密顿量的实部和虚部。"
msgstr "The real and imaginary parts of the off-site SOC Hamiltonian."

#: 079fc8b548f743a6b319ec88c609f678
msgid "包含能带能量和波函数的元组。"
msgstr "A tuple containing band energies and wave functions."

#: b888c4b5dd7f409488c28bc71872d57c
msgid "根据每种元素的实际轨道基组，屏蔽哈密顿量/重叠矩阵中不存在的元素。"
msgstr ""
"Masks non-existent elements in the Hamiltonian/overlap matrix based on the "
"actual orbital basis set of each element."

#: 5245425f04df46798b6069e82c692d6c
msgid "由于模型为所有原子预测一个固定大小（nao_max * nao_max）的矩阵块， 此函数用于将那些对应于该原子实际未使用的轨道的矩阵元素置零。"
msgstr ""
"Since the model predicts a fixed-size (nao_max * nao_max) matrix block for "
"all atoms, this function is used to zero out the matrix elements "
"corresponding to orbitals that are not actually used by that atom."

#: 98a8d55c9bff42d09f20a176da8a2b7b
msgid "屏蔽后的在位和异位矩阵块 (Hon_mask, Hoff_mask)。"
msgstr "The masked on-site and off-site matrix blocks (Hon_mask, Hoff_mask)."

#: a328434550134ab7aec0fadf43fa3ea6
msgid "将 SOC 哈密顿量的实部和虚部组合成一个复数张量。"
msgstr ""
"Combines the real and imaginary parts of the SOC Hamiltonian into a complex "
"tensor."

#: 1026f829c9d24b72bcdb13ae28d821db
msgid "哈密顿量的实部。"
msgstr "The real part of the Hamiltonian."

#: 605685075abb44abae2ce8603d7a9db9
msgid "哈密顿量的虚部。"
msgstr "The imaginary part of the Hamiltonian."

#: da7feb629b454734aad18754061dbf57
msgid "复数形式的 SOC 哈密顿量。"
msgstr "The SOC Hamiltonian in complex form."

#: 96acd0e0058c41648bb2c06077038df7
msgid "对 SOC 耦合系数进行降维/平均化处理。"
msgstr "Reduces/averages the SOC coupling coefficients."

#: 7507ea869a904a51b10464f0e551f4c5
msgid ""
"在某些基组定义下，属于同一轨道壳层（如 p, d, f）的多个轨道 被假定共享同一个 SOC 耦合系数。此函数通过对这些轨道的系数 "
"取平均值来实现这一点。"
msgstr ""
"Under certain basis set definitions, multiple orbitals belonging to the "
"same orbital shell (e.g., p, d, f) are assumed to share the same SOC "
"coupling coefficient. This function achieves this by averaging the "
"coefficients of these orbitals."

#: 11ae33c7c33d4980a5e0cb3222fb388b
msgid "原始的 SOC 耦合系数矩阵。"
msgstr "The original SOC coupling coefficient matrix."

#: 48566d91d3a2462fa023ad3750972865
msgid "处理后的系数矩阵。"
msgstr "The processed coefficient matrix."

#: 13ed2c2fcbfa4f94988837d57e9bf795
msgid "模型的前向传播。"
msgstr "The forward pass of the model."

#: 4823ed25f0524241bf75e79c807111e3
msgid "输入数据字典。"
msgstr "Input data dictionary."

#: c7648978417e44f99eaf4a33fcda988b
msgid "由表示网络预先计算的特征字典。"
msgstr "A dictionary of features pre-computed by the representation network."

#: 0bcba4acf91a468a989eec474f686ac9
msgid "包含预测的哈密顿量、重叠矩阵、能带能量等结果的字典。"
msgstr ""
"A dictionary containing results such as the predicted Hamiltonian, overlap "
"matrix, and band energies."

